WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.734
This is the public RankLens home.

00:00:02.734 --> 00:00:05.807
Read the feature and privacy sections first.

00:00:05.807 --> 00:00:11.952
Choose Log in for the private website list, or Add website to begin setup.

00:00:11.952 --> 00:00:16.342
The public analytics preview is separate from your private account.

00:00:16.542 --> 00:00:19.103
After signing in, open Add website.

00:00:19.103 --> 00:00:25.934
Enter a domain that you own, then choose the timezone that should define each report day.

00:00:25.934 --> 00:00:31.484
Review the domain before submitting; a site is created for this account only.

00:00:31.684 --> 00:00:38.238
Copy the unique tracking script shown for that site and add it to your website's shared head section.

00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:45.520
Visit a page on that domain yourself, wait for the request to finish, then return to its report and refresh.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:49.526
A blank chart is normal until a real page view arrives.

00:00:49.726 --> 00:00:51.544
Revenue attribution is optional.

00:00:51.544 --> 00:00:56.546
First let Stripe, Razorpay, or your provider confirm a captured payment.

00:00:56.546 --> 00:01:02.911
Only then send the matching event from your server using a private site key.

00:01:02.911 --> 00:01:09.732
Send refunds as separate verified events; never claim success based only on a browser redirect.
